## Known, intentional gaps (not bugs)

- **Replies, Unsubscribes/Opt-outs, Spam Complaints, Block Rate** — not implemented for either channel (would need an inbound-message webhook / suppression list / ESP webhook).
- **Historical campaigns** sent before 2026-07-15 have no click/open/conversion/cost data — tracking only applies going forward.
- **Apple Mail Privacy Protection** and corporate link-scanners (Defender Safe Links) pre-fetch the email pixel/links regardless of real opens — inflates Email Opens/Clicks for those recipients. Industry-wide limitation, not fixable from our side.
